  "content": "<p>喜愛模組與IC2的完美組合！<br>終於在1.19.2版本中體驗IC2啦！<br><br>在這個模組包中，IC2是主角，搭配了許多次世代模組，包括林業（Forestry）、更好的原版工具（Better Vanilla Tools）等等⋯⋯<br><br>這個模組包主要加入了電力系統，你可以透過太陽能板、風力發電機甚至核反應爐來發電。<br>同時也加入了電腦系統，支援無線儲存功能（沒錯，你在挖礦或探險時也能查看你的箱子！），還有許多自訂礦物，如鈾礦、紅寶石和藍寶石，可以用來製作更多工具和防具。所有功能都搭配簡潔的使用者介面，搜尋欄內包含所有物品。<br>最後但同樣重要的是⋯⋯模組包加入了口渴值系統，運作方式就像飢餓值一樣！玩家們記得多補充水分啊！&nbsp;</p><p>何不親自來看看呢？<br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ic2-classic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">IC2 Classic</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forestry-community-edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forestry Community</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-one-probe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">The One Probe</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jade\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jade</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-village-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Villages</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jump-over-fences-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jump over Fences</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/visual-workbench\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Visual Workbench</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/morevanillaarmor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MoreVanillaArmor</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/morevanillaarmor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MoreVanillaTools</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-fences\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Diagonal Fences</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-windows\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Diagonal Windows</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-netherite\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Upgraded Netherite</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upgraded-tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Upgraded Tools</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/travelers-backpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Travelers Backpack</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thirst-was-taken\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Thirst Was Taken</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inventory-sorter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Inventory-Sorter</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iron-chests\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron Chests</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iron-furnaces\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron Furnaces</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/double-doors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Double Doors</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/sketch_macaw/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Macaw Doors, Furniture, Windows, Bridges, Fences and Walls, Stairs, Roofs</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/not-enough-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Not Enough Animations</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/towns-and-towers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Towns and Towers</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/grabby-mobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Grabby Mobs</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/storage-drawers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Storage Drawers</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-storage-network\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simple Storage Network</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Items</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-minimap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero's Map</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-mobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex's Mobs</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-calculation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Calculation</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jade-addons-ic2classic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jade IC2 Addon</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-ores-in-one\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Ores In One</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dynamic Trees</a><br><br>本人並不擁有此模組包中的任何模組。<br>此模組包由社群為社群製作。</p>",
